  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Colour chapters",
    "overview": "Colour chapters give DEJOIY a bold, human-led business presence: uninterrupted mint, paper, deep green and coral fields carry oversized warm grotesk headlines and direct routes into services. Three linked sculptural rings express the shared metaphor \u201cPeople. Process. Possibility.\u201d\n\nThis is a code-led implementation, with no approved image composition. The homepage establishes the full visual language; shared interiors preserve their content and functions within green surfaces, mint controls and image-led services. Repository photography is illustrative, not verified team photography.",
